BOSS Mordrax Chat During
    Events
        Unit - A unit Is issued an order targeting an object
    Conditions
        BossMordrax_VoicelineActive Equal to False
        (Ordered unit) Equal to BossMordrax
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Issued order) Equal to (Order(attack))
                (Issued order) Equal to (Order(smart))
        IsUnitAlive[(Custom value of BossMordrax)] Equal to True
        (Remaining time for BossMordrax_VoicelineTimer) Equal to 0.00
        InCinematic Equal to False
    Actions
        -------- ============ RANGE CHECK --------
        Custom script:   local real range = RangeCheck_Unit(udg_BossMordrax, Player(0))
        Custom script:   if range >= 1500.0 then
        Custom script:   return
        Custom script:   endif
        -------- ============ RANGE END --------
        Set VariableSet BossMordrax_LinesInt = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
        Set VariableSet BossMordrax_VoicelineActive = True
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossMordrax_LinesInt Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = The skies shall burn by my wrath!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Mordrax_0002", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BossMordrax named Mordrax: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Don't wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossMordrax_LinesInt Equal to 2
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = I will destroy you!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Mordrax_0003", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BossMordrax named Mordrax: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Don't wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossMordrax_LinesInt Equal to 3
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Pathetic weaklings!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Mordrax_0004", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BossMordrax named Mordrax: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Don't wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        Countdown Timer - Start BossMordrax_VoicelineTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in (ExSoundDuration + 10.00) seconds
